egate principal of $ 1.660 billion for $ 1.711 billion, which included $ 50 million of premium and $ 1 million of accrued interest. The redemption is treated as an extinguishment of debt, with any realized premium recognized as a loss on debt extinguishment in the accompanying unaudited condensed consolidated statements of operations, net of write-offs of related unamortized debt issuance costs and unamortized premium. As a result of the redemption, during the three months ended September 30, 2026, the Company recognized a net loss on debt extinguishment of $ 53 million, which included $ 3 million of write-offs of related unamortized debt issuance costs and unamortized premium.",
